      "updated": 1795379313903,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• All calls use HTTPS.\n• Every API key is stored in the n8n encrypted credential store.\n• The Cloud Run ML service rejects calls without a valid X-API-Key header.",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• All calls use HTTPS.\n• Every API key is stored in the n8n encrypted credential store.\n• The Cloud Run ML service rejects calls without a valid X-API-Key header.",
