      "text": "• Personal information (PII) is redacted in n8n before anything is stored\n  or sent to an AI model.\n• ML inference runs in South Africa (africa-south1, Johannesburg).",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Personal information (PII) is redacted in n8n before anything is stored\n  or sent to an AI model.\n• ML inference runs in South Africa (africa-south1, Johannesburg).",
