      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795379313903,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• The n8n host is the central orchestrator: every external service is called\n  by n8n and returns its result to n8n.\n• No service talks to the user directly except through Meta's WhatsApp API.",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• The n8n host is the central orchestrator: every external service is called\n  by n8n and returns its result to n8n.\n• No service talks to the user directly except through Meta's WhatsApp API.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
